  "id": "NoNukeAftermath",
  "displayName": "Nuke Aftermath",
  "description": "A far bigger nuclear blast that leaves a mark. The game's own fireball and mushroom cloud grow about 1.6 times bigger and last longer, with a brighter flash, a dust wall along the ground and a condensation ring. Afterwards the ground stays burnt, charred trunks lie flat pointing away from ground zero, and fires and smoke burn for minutes. Client-only and visual-only: other players do not need it, and it changes no damage or gameplay.",
